{"ticker":"SW","updated":"2026-10-24T00:14:19Z","profile":{"longName":"Smurfit Westrock Plc","shortName":"Smurfit WestRock plc","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.smurfitwestrock.com","fullTimeEmployees":96000,"marketCap":21951283200,"trailingPE":44.05263,"forwardPE":11.796042,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.7007369,"pegRatio":0.26,"targetMeanPrice":56.56667,"targetHighPrice":69.0,"targetLowPrice":46.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.011,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.18160999,"operatingMargins":0.05466,"profitMargins":0.01587,"totalRevenue":31325999104,"beta":0.914,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":52.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":32.729,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.26},"summary":"Smurfit Westrock Plc, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distributes, and sells containerboard, corrugated containers, and other paper-based packaging products in North America, South America, Europe, Asia, Africa, Australia, and internationally. The company produces containerboard and paperboard; packaging of corrugated containers; consumer packaging; and offers solid board, kraft paper, and graphic board, as well as other packaging products, such as solidboard packaging, paper sacks and bag-in-box. It produces linerboard and corrugated medium and paperboard; and other paper-based packaging, such as folding cartons, inserts, labels and displays. The company primarily serves food and beverage, healthcare, beauty and personal care, garden, consumer goods, industrial, and foodservice markets. It markets its products through its own sales force, independent sales representatives, and independent distributors. Smurfit Westrock Plc was founded in 1934 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","summary_zh":"Smurfit Westrock Plc 及其子公司在北美、南美、歐洲、亞洲、非洲、澳洲和國際上製造、分銷和銷售箱板紙、瓦楞紙箱和其他紙質包裝產品。該公司生產箱板紙和紙板；瓦楞紙箱的包裝；消費品包裝；並提供實心紙板、牛皮紙和圖畫板，以及其他包裝產品，如實心紙板包裝、紙袋和盒中袋。生產掛麵紙板、瓦楞原紙和紙板；以及其他紙質包裝，例如折疊紙盒、插頁、標籤和展示架。該公司主要服務於食品和飲料、醫療保健、美容和個人護理、園藝、消費品、工業和餐飲服務市場。它透過自己的銷售團隊、獨立的銷售代表和獨立的分銷商來行銷其產品。 Smurfit Westrock Plc 成立於 1934 年，總部位於愛爾蘭都柏林。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"包裝與容器","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":45.54,"h":45.94,"l":45.35,"c":45.93,"v":2931100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":44.755,"h":46.415,"l":44.755,"c":46.3,"v":4953700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":45.81,"h":45.965,"l":45.27,"c":45.66,"v":4069300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":46.16,"h":46.43,"l":45.49,"c":46.39,"v":3503600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":46.37,"h":47.47,"l":46.29,"c":47.36,"v":4320700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":46.06,"h":47.17,"l":46.035,"c":47.11,"v":3312300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":47.8,"h":47.8,"l":46.711,"c":46.95,"v":4490500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":46.72,"h":46.925,"l":45.42,"c":46.17,"v":3809800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":46.33,"h":47.265,"l":46.19,"c":46.91,"v":2339700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":47.36,"h":47.54,"l":45.49,"c":46.69,"v":3329000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":46.47,"h":46.73,"l":44.855,"c":45.36,"v":3359200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":45.26,"h":45.67,"l":44.89,"c":45.27,"v":3530600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":45.02,"h":45.835,"l":44.93,"c":45.64,"v":2898500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":45.03,"h":45.35,"l":44.22,"c":44.27,"v":3339100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":45.85,"h":45.85,"l":44.405,"c":44.47,"v":3906000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":44.22,"h":44.53,"l":43.575,"c":44.28,"v":3386100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":44.35,"h":45.27,"l":43.93,"c":44.04,"v":3334200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":44.38,"h":44.57,"l":43.74,"c":44.17,"v":3417000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":44.315,"h":44.4,"l":43.2,"c":43.82,"v":19817700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":43.57,"h":43.78,"l":43.22,"c":43.48,"v":4016800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":44.01,"h":44.47,"l":43.57,"c":43.81,"v":3275800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":43.67,"h":44.41,"l":42.995,"c":43.25,"v":2766700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":42.5,"h":43.0,"l":42.14,"c":42.28,"v":4076300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":42.31,"h":42.61,"l":41.715,"c":42.13,"v":2856800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":42.31,"h":42.35,"l":41.9,"c":42.21,"v":2